# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Nothing here is required to run the site —
# with ENQUIRY_WEBHOOK_URL unset, /api/enquiry writes submissions to the server
# log instead of delivering them, so the form works end to end in development.

# Where homepage enquiries are delivered. Any endpoint that accepts a JSON POST:
# a Zapier or Make webhook, a Google Apps Script bound to a Sheet, or a CRM
# intake URL. The payload is { name, email, phone, source, receivedAt }.
#
# To deliver by email instead, edit deliver() in app/api/enquiry/route.ts — it
# is the single place delivery happens.
ENQUIRY_WEBHOOK_URL=
